### Komponen Utama yang Dibangun

#### 1. Koneksi Database PDO ([database.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/config/database.php))
- **Singleton Pattern** — satu koneksi per request
- **Prepared statements** — aman dari SQL injection
- **Try-catch** lengkap dengan error logging ke file
- **Helper methods**: `fetchAll()`, `fetch()`, `execute()`, `count()`, `beginTransaction()`
- **Error pages** styled untuk mode debug & production

#### 2. MVC Core
- [App.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/core/App.php) — Router dengan URL mapping & dash-to-camelCase
- [Controller.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/core/Controller.php) — `requireLogin()`, `requireRole()`, `view()`, `redirect()`, CSRF, flash messages
- [Model.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/core/Model.php) — CRUD, mass assignment protection, `paginate()`, `raw()`
- [Helpers.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/core/Helpers.php) — `format_tanggal()`, `status_badge()`, `role_badge()`, `get_initials()`, `e()`

#### 3. Template Global (Tailwind CSS + Lucide Icons)
- [header.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/views/templates/header.php) — Tailwind CDN config, Google Fonts Inter, top navbar dengan search/notifications/profile dropdown
- [sidebar.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/views/templates/sidebar.php) — Menu RBAC-based, section dividers, active page pulse, mobile responsive
- [footer.php](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/views/templates/footer.php) — Search modal (Ctrl+K), Lucide Icons init, custom JS

#### 4. Custom UI ([style.css](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/assets/css/style.css) + [app.js](file:///c:/xampp/htdocs/SimAkreditasi/assets/js/app.js))
- Glassmorphism cards, stat cards with color glow
- Dark theme form inputs, selects, textareas
- Gradient buttons (primary, success, danger, warning, outline, ghost)
- Data tables, tooltips, progress bars, skeleton loaders
- Mobile sidebar toggle, profile dropdown, Ctrl+K search
- File upload preview with validation
- Auto-dismiss flash messages

